KreaBankAboutWhatTitle=What This Module Does
KreaBankAboutWhatText=KreaBank is a bank reconciliation workspace for Dolibarr. It imports statements, keeps a staging layer for review, and guides users through safe reconciliation against native bank, payment, invoice, and accounting objects.
KreaBankAboutFriendlyPurposeTitle=Purpose In Plain Language
KreaBankAboutFriendlyPurposeText=In simple terms, KreaBank helps you take a bank statement, find what each line belongs to in Dolibarr, and either reconcile it, keep it pending, or create the missing accounting flow.
KreaBankAboutPurposeTitle=What It Is For
KreaBankAboutPurposeText=Use it when bank files arrive in different layouts and the finance team needs controlled reconciliation, pending queues, quick-entry flows, and auditability without bypassing Dolibarr native bank data.
KreaBankAboutCapabilitiesTitle=Main Capabilities
KreaBankAboutCapabilityImport=Import and map CSV, XLS, XLSX, OFX, MT940, CAMT.053, Norma 43, and supported bank text exports.
KreaBankAboutCapabilityMatch=Suggest matching open documents and native bank entries with assisted dual-pane reconciliation and batch detection.
KreaBankAboutCapabilityQuickEntry=Create quick payment, tax, or supplier invoice flows directly from a statement line when the source document does not exist yet.
KreaBankAboutCapabilityAudit=Track pending lines, reconciliation history, and audit records for operational follow-up and control.

